## Key Learnings
- Amazon EBS is block storage used with EC2 instances.
- Amazon EFS is a managed file storage service.
- EBS can be attached to one EC2 instance (in most common scenarios).
- EFS can be mounted on multiple EC2 instances simultaneously.
- Snapshots are used to back up EBS volumes.

